From 24ebdb7992a7b5c33040c2ca625a95a7d26745bf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 05:54:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: hiring requisition workflow (dept head -> Head HR
 assign -> HR -> founder -> JD -> job)

- New native Requisitions module under Talent Acquisition (replaces the n8n requisition link)
- Workflow: PENDING_ASSIGNMENT -> PENDING_HR -> PENDING_FOUNDER -> JD_DRAFT -> JOB_OPEN (or REJECTED/CLOSED)
- Head HR assigns/reassigns an HR owner who handles all later steps; founder can assign as a fallback
- HR approval requires a supporting document (<=700 KB inline) and forwards to founder
- AI job description generation (Gemini, template fallback) with full manual editing, then publish
- Roles panel: founder appoints Head HR, founder/Head HR flag department heads; changes audited
- Department heads get a "Hiring requests" panel in the employee portal (additive only)
- can() permission helper is the single source of truth for who may do what
- Firestore rules for `requisitions` (must be deployed); audit actions and email notifications added

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LDTpgSWNwWJUQSLtT2tujN
